      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احنّ القَوْسَ</span></b>  <i>He made the bow to</i> [<i>twang,</i>
or] <i>give a sound,</i> [by pulling, and then letting
go, the string.] (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احنّ</span> <i>He</i> (a man.
TA) <i>did wrong, committed a mistake,</i> or <i>missed</i>
[the object of his aim]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 2.

